ub_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2879270482","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101758#issuecomment-2879270482","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101758","id":2879270482,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rni5S","user":{"login":"MattParkerDev","id":61717342,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNzE3MzQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61717342?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev","html_url":"https://github.com/MattParkerDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T08:25:22Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T08:25:22Z","body":"Interestingly this bug may manifest as the often mentioned \"stutter\" the first time a GPUParticles3D is used after starting the game. It's possible that instead, its just a new GPUParticles3D causing them all to stutter","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2879270482/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124444730","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101758#issuecomment-3124444730","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101758","id":3124444730,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66Oz46","user":{"login":"mustardbucket1234","id":86981811,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTgxODEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86981811?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234","html_url":"https://github.com/mustardbucket1234","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-27T14:12:40Z","updated_at":"2025-07-27T14:12:40Z","body":"I'm using Godot 4.5 Beta 2 and am noticing the same 1-frame pause when spawning in particles in my 3D game.\n\nI think this is a different problem than the stutter that occurs when initially loading in particles. Stutter occurs due to Shader compilation, and usually pauses the game loop for multiple frames.\n\nI'm noticing this issue occurs every time you spawn in particles, not just the first. This issue only pauses for exactly 1-frame and doesn't pause the game loop (only the particles pause but rest of the game keeps on running as normal).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124444730/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124806957","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101758#issuecomment-3124806957","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101758","id":3124806957,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66QMUt","user":{"login":"mustardbucket1234","id":86981811,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTgxODEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86981811?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234","html_url":"https://github.com/mustardbucket1234","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mustardbucket1234/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-27T23:57:01Z","updated_at":"2025-07-27T23:57:01Z","body":"I put more testing into this when trying to solve the issue in my game\n\nThe freeze occurs whenever a GPUParticles3D is added to the tree. The freeze lasts for exactly 1 frame regardless of the Max FPS the game was running at. This means that the bug is much more obvious when targeting 60 or 30 fps\n\nThe freeze only impacts the rendering of the GPUParticles3D, the rest of the game runs smoothly\n\nI was able to work around this issue by adding object pooling to all of the particles in my game. As long as you avoid adding GPUParticles3D into the tree, you can freely reuse the previously spawned in GPUParticles3D without stutter.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124806957/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3174587350","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101758#issuecomment-3174587350","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101758","id":3174587350,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69OFvW","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-11T12:37:08Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T12:37:08Z","body":"Can you try with interpolation disabled and fixed FPS set to zero?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com